* From C. L. Baker, "JOSS: Scenario of a Filmed Report", RAND RM-4162-PR, June 1964: the film of 21 March 1964, pages 4 to 6 and examples 1 and 2.
! joss 1964
1.1 Type x, sqrt(x), log(x), exp(x), _.
! interrupt after 16 lines
Do step 1.1 for x = 1(1)100.
1.1 Type x, sqrt(x), log(x), exp(x) in form 1.
Form1:*
Form 1:
___  __._______  __._______   .............
! interrupt after 6 lines
Go.
1.05 Do part 2 if fp(x/40) = 1/40.
2.1 Page.
2.2 Type form 2.
Form 2:
 X     SQRT(X)     LOG(X)        EXP(X)
! interrupt after 9 lines
Do part 1 for x = 1(1)100.
1.07 Line if fp(x/5) = 1/5.
Do part 1 for x = 1(1)100.
Type all.
